    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>--- Fail, learn, and conquer!---</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A simple yet challenging &quot;die-and-retry&quot; 2D action game is here!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Try out the demo to see if it suits you!</strong><br><br><strong>And if you're ready for the full challenge, add it to your wish list! </strong><br><strong>Scheduled for release in April 2025!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>----------------------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The tower in this game is packed with all sorts of brutal, unfair traps,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One hit from spikes or enemies means instant death...</strong><br><br><strong>With simple controls, your gaming skills and perseverance will be put to the test...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But don't worry\u2014if you're not aiming for an S rank, even casual gamers should be able to clear the game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilize the three powers of &quot;Fire,&quot; &quot;Ice,&quot; and &quot;Wind&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>and aim for an S rank in all 33 stages!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How many times will you die before reaching the end...?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh, and there are 15 achievements too!</strong><br><strong>Try to collect them all!</strong><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592860/extras/e2bedc4e7f6dcee44e691c0becd54ffa.avif?t=1744302589\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong> </strong> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you manage to clear the entire game <strong>without a single mistake</strong> on your first attempt,<br>you\u2019re either a clairvoyant or a gamer with insane skills and reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer firmly believes that <strong>90% of players will get a game over at the first stage\u2019s trap</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you do manage to clear the entire game without game over on your first try, <br>please report it to <strong>Clover Soft\u2019s X account</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong></strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorry for my poor English:(</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
